#12101
The Gates of Haven~
   A set of iron gates to the south marks the entrance to the coastal town of
Haven, renowned for its trade prowess, seafaring population, and the usual
opportunity to make some quick gold. Alongside the road to the north, a small
temple stands. A cobblestone road begins at the gates, and exends southward,
well into the town.
~
