#12102
A Cobblestone Road in Haven~
   This cobblestone road begins at the gates to the north and extends south,
providing the main thoroughfare for Haven's mostly pedestrian traffic. A
number of wagons pass by, heavily laden with goods on their way to the cities
of Kir Drax'in and Kir Morthis. A group of fishermen stare at you intently,
but say nothing. The sound of laughter drifts across the road from the open
doors of a double-story building to the west, a small sign proclaiming it as
the Drunken Jig Inn. The Haven Customs House is on the east side of the road.
~
