#12106
The Drunken Jig Inn~
   A small group of merchants sits in deep discussion in this corner of the
inn, but unfortunately, the noise from the drunken patrons prevents you from
hearing what is being said. You almost trip over one of the tables as you
attempt to get closer, and decide in the end it's not worth the trouble. To
the north, sailors continue to stream into the inn from the town, and it won't
be long before it will be standing room only.
