#12108
The Town Square~
   The town square is central to Haven, and provides a meeting place for the
locals, as well as a social area for the many creatures that frequent the area.
Several benches on the perimeter of the square form a loose circle around a
small, wooden platform in the middle of the street. A number of traders have
set up makeshift stalls along the edge of the street, each trying to get your
attention in an effort to sell their goods.
   A signpost on the corner of the square points southward to the town docks
and east to Guild road. A pathway to the west leads down the back roads of the
city.
~
