The Sleeping Quarters~
   With the lack of use, the innkeeper no longer pays for the upkeep of these
rooms, which is evident by the rubbish which litters the floor, and the filthy
mattress in the corner of the room. It's a wonder that anyone would choose to
stay here at all, but you are unlikely to be disturbed should you wish to do
