#12113
The Guild Road~
   Although relatively small, the town of Haven is well known for the amount of
goods that travel its roads. As such, a group of merchants long ago created a
guild; a place to relax away from the hustle and bustle of sea-life and to
exchange both tales and trade routes. Second only to the tavern in size, the
guild is a large building, and can be entered through a door to the south.
   A small building to the north houses the town public works office.
~
