#12115
The End of the Guild Road~
   The road deteriorates here into nothing more than a sandy path that slopes
down to the east. This is clearly the outskirts of Haven, as the edge of the
small town blends seamlessly into the surrounding wilderness.
   There are similar buildings to the north and south, each with a sign above
the doorway. The Guild Road continues in its cobblestone form to the west.
