A Cobblestone Road in Haven~
   Merchants pass you by as you walk along the cobblestone road, some of them
more concerned with the storage of their goods than with harassing you. To
the east and west, large warehouses hold the trade goods before they are
transported out of the town. A little further to the south, you can see
