#12123
A Small Warehouse~
   The warehouse has been constructed from clay bricks, and has a thatched roof
to prevent damage to the goods stored within. There appears to be no way of
controlling what goods belong to which merchant, but perhaps the fear of death
at the hands of the more unruly elements of this town keeps most of them safe.
   The warehouse opens onto the main road to the east.
~
