#12127
The Boardwalk~
   You stand at the beginning of one of three main docks in the port town of
Haven. A wooden boardwalk to the west and east joins the three docks together,
and provides a shop-front for merchant stalls where some of the less expensive
goods can be sold to local citizens. Several large ships are anchored out in
the bay, preferring to dock here only to unload cargo.
   A cobblestone road begins to the north, and forms the main road through the
town.
~
