#12134
The Fishmonger's Store~
   The majority of fish bought into Haven is packaged here and taken away to be
sold in other cities. Old crates have been left around the floor, filled with
those fish deemed unacceptable for sale elsewhere. You can see no sign of
refrigeration or preservation, and can only assume these fish are fresh,
although, judging by the odor, you're not so sure. You can walk back onto the
boardwalk through the door to the south.
~
