#12137
The Mariners Roost~
   It is here that sailors and pirates alike come to purchase new ships. The
walls are covered in large parchments detailing the latest in designs, and a
single desk sits in the corner of the room. You take a moment to glance at an
open book on the desk, and learn that, due to an infestation in the supply of
lumber, the production and sales of ships has ceased, temporarily. There are,
however, a number of small one-person boats available for purchase.
~
